{
  "id": "round-robin-table",
  "title": "Round Robin Table",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "tags": [
    "hash map",
    "sorting"
  ],
  "description": "Each entry in `matches` is `[playerA, playerB, winner]`, where `winner` is one of the two players. Build the standings table: every player who appears in any match, ordered by number of wins (most first), then by name alphabetically.\n\nReturn a list of `[name, wins]` pairs. Players with zero wins are included.",
